  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/dc3b4c86-73d2-46ba-9d37-01f2c95eb585-image.png\" style=\"width: 288px; height: 198px;\" /></p><p>Energy stored in an inductor,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>L</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math><br />and power dissipated in a resistor,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>640</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math><br />Time constant of the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;circuit is,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#964;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p>",
